WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.320
Oh. Hello CZsWorld.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:20.740
My name is Kaneki and I will be taking over this channel for the month of October.

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:27.640
During this time I will be uploading every Sunday, so listen up closely, because here is what you'll be getting.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.700
We'll start off with a web-series called True Fear,

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.740
in which CZ will be telling you about the horrors of the real world.

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:38.880
You'll also be getting a new short horror film entitled, Remote Threat.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.300
Then you'll be getting another new web-series called Al Dente Creepypasta.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.780
Which is exactly what it sounds like.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:51.960
To finish up this month, I'll be releasing a brand new episode of The Wokking Dead.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:54.160
So be sure to look out for that.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:58.520
At the end of the month I'll be returning CZ to you.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:02.560
It turns out that he was not very tasty at all.

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:07.100
But when you do get him back, things are going to be a little bit different.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:13.520
I've done a little bargaining with CZ... And when he comes back, he'll be uploading every two weeks.

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.860
Well... I've got a lot to do this month, so I'd better get to it.

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:20.900
But before I leave, let me just say one more thing...

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.640
Let's Go Cubbies!

